# Files in frontend/ that must NOT be pushed to Apps Script.
#
# mock_server.html is the dev-only stand-in for google.script.run. Index.html
# references it only from its local-preview loader (a client-side fetch that
# never runs under Apps Script), so pushing it would be harmless — it bails out
# immediately when google.script.run exists — but there is no reason to ship a
# fake server alongside the real one.
mock_server.html
**/mock_server.html

# Documentation, not code.
DEPLOY.md
**/DEPLOY.md
